From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 09:29:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] editor GPU compute foundation: Direct3D 11 compute backend
 for the field engine (EdGpu, EdGpuOps, EdGpuLua), kernel language that is
 HLSL and C++ at once (gpu/*.hlsl, hlsl_cpp_shim.h) with a CPU emulator for
 tests, generated shader header, template ops blur / box, self test, ed_gpu_*
 natives and ed_gpu_compute / ed_gpu_min_cells / ed_gpu_selftest_first, field
 engine interceptor + per-op statistics (RunOp / RunOpCpu), tests (EdGpuTest)

Nothing was run on a GPU: the D3D11 code is only syntax checked against stub headers; the kernels and the op glue are tested on the CPU emulator (213 checks).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01F37er45a7etRuMgEW1q3kY

